879", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568677_385047449735212_1464954907125954336_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LFRbg4Yd5qYQ7kNvwF9ZcDV&_nc_oc=Ado1pBV5HNhqHvXCmw9IKCPbgve02W5317Q3uc-S72NuPIz0tZfGiAGupJO-g7V4Q7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6L2vgf5aY1K70RU4UAY2kkDcM2oM0tNpfH_90bPxjc5Q&oe=6A1AF91C"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "320476236543044", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572918_320476239876377_4860331478258876036_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LmTIF0oCREEQ7kNvwE-G_Xt&_nc_oc=Adpa_opQxUNEpA1PohlwmM4Q4h4Nbg93OrlQ2PeoIo42Z3IP8XnwcpkR-bVEZ0H2yr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7TP3abykeO75m3LVzTQAnpHWNM4CY1SjfWnNifLFY0aA&oe=6A1B0790"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "COVER.png", "id": "4980790088603842", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569456_4980790091937175_8848556797338170656_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Da8vUwHWtEkQ7kNvwET9tZI&_nc_oc=Adqy6YkjFLG79UOB20OeSlHP-4Fmq2eNbaxMmpFaCpSnZjqMOYIkyglJwMDBQebPVTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4BwpXr5YC9wdAfXoen57IQZ-o5u92vF7b6jI5d78n2ZQ&oe=6A1AF44A"}, "display_name": "OceanRoute", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Operation Description\n\nLeft stick (up/down) (vertical rotation of viewpoint)\nRight stick (up/down) (Speed Change)\nLR Trigger(Brightness change)\n\n\nA button \uff08decision / BGM change)\nB button \uff08decision / Description On/Off)\nX or Y Button (BGM volume change)", "short_description": "This app is designed for healing and relaxation.\n\nIn this app, you will experience \"\njust keep running along the Ocean road\".\n\nThis experience,\n which may seem monotonous in some ways, \nmay give your tired brain a break.\n\nIf you have trouble sleeping \nor \nif your brain is tired, try using this app.\n\nThis app also inclu